audBarre/eslint-plugin-react-refresh/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/ArnaudBarre/eslint-plugin-react-refresh/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/ArnaudBarre/eslint-plugin-react-refresh/compare/v0.4.26...v0.5.0)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: eslint-plugin-react-refresh\n  dependency-version: 0.5.0\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  update-type: version-update:semver-minor\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* fix(lint): suppress react-refresh warnings for compound components\n\nThe Object.assign pattern used for compound components (Form, Sidebar)\ntriggers false positives in eslint-plugin-react-refresh 0.5.0.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Brandon Jernigan <brandon@whatisboom.com>","tree":{"sha":"25d25c951fb4903f4163aa006ab7cf772d2de5e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/trees/25d25c951fb4903f4163aa006ab7cf772d2de5e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/commits/237f17c50c45cf99e8d98de0635637b090edff9a","verification":{"payload":"tree 25d25c951fb4903f4163aa006ab7cf772d2de5e9\nparent 467b5ef0579750573706865d270d09e597adb83a\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1771212493 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771212493 +0000\n\nchore(deps-dev): bump eslint-plugin-react-refresh from 0.4.26 to 0.5.0 (#105)\n\n* chore(deps-dev): bump eslint-plugin-react-refresh from 0.4.26 to 0.5.0\n\nBumps [eslint-plugin-react-refresh](https://github.com/ArnaudBarre/eslint-plugin-react-refresh) from 0.4.26 to 0.5.0.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/ArnaudBarre/eslint-plugin-react-refresh/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/ArnaudBarre/eslint-plugin-react-refresh/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/ArnaudBarre/eslint-plugin-react-refresh/com