ll inline color manipulation from DocsContainer (~80 lines)\n- Remove redundant background addon configuration from preview.ts\n- Add storybook-theme.css with token-based styles for Storybook UI\n- Add --boom-theme-primary-text token for better contrast\n- Update Button outline/ghost/link variants to use primary-text token\n- Adjust Switch padding and positioning for better alignment\n- Update base palette hue to 50 (warm brown-gray) with adjusted saturation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3dc29a75673f1c937515b0f02227332b0af81cfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/trees/3dc29a75673f1c937515b0f02227332b0af81cfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/commits/b76d0a049888dceb576b90837e81a69555fcb05c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/whatisboom","id":123084,"login":"whatisboom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzA4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/whatisboom/boom-ui/commit/b76d0a049888dceb576b90837e81a69555fcb05c","node_id":"C_kwDOQtUQc9oAKGI3NmQwYTA0OTg4OGRjZWI1NzZiOTA4MzdlODFhNjk1NTVmY2IwNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/whatisboom/boom-ui/commit/80eb9ed517eb020ffceaa40399b6a5b87923ed1d","sha":"80eb9ed517eb020ffceaa40399b6a5b87923ed1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/commits/80eb9ed517eb020ffceaa40399b6a5b87923ed1d"}],"sha":"b76d0a049888dceb576b90837e81a69555fcb05c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/commits/b76d0a049888dceb576b90837e81a69555fcb05c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123084?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/whatisboom","id":123084,"login":"whatisboom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMzA4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whatisboom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/commits/35c6bc740908ec21c1728847367fa0b271a5f473/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T02:50:19Z","email":"brandon@whatisboom.com","name":"Brandon Jernigan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T02:50:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix checkbox vertical layout shift (#87)\n\n* Fix checkbox vertical shift by stabilizing DOM structure\n\nChanged checkmark SVG from conditionally rendered to always rendered\nbut conditionally visible using CSS opacity. This prevents layout\nrecalculation when toggling checked state, eliminating vertical shift\nof content below the checkbox.\n\n- Remove conditional rendering of SVG element\n- Add CSS rule to hide checkmark with opacity: 0 when unchecked\n- Matches stable rendering pattern used by Switch component\n\n* Fix TableHeaderCell test to check specifically for SortIndicator\n\nUpdated test to look for SortIndicator class instead of any SVG element.\nThis prevents false positives from the Checkbox checkmark SVG which is\nnow always present in the DOM (just hidden with opacity when unchecked).","tree":{"sha":"e11fdecd1fcd865b9c840637e3a5e8e027ed2405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/trees/e11fdecd1fcd865b9c840637e3a5e8e027ed2405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/commits/35c6bc740908ec21c1728847367fa0b271a5f473","verification":{"payload":"tree e11fdecd1fcd865b9c840637e3a5e8e027ed2405\nparent c6d7e3b5e6b43af19d2420f67b88b0623a69a91d\nauthor Brandon Jernigan <brandon@whatisboom.com> 1769482219 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769482219 +0000\n\nFix checkbox vertical layout shift (#87)\n\n* Fix checkbox vertical shift by stabilizing DOM structure\n\nChanged checkmark SVG from conditionally rendered to always rendered\nbut conditionally visible using CSS opacity. This prevents layout\nrecalculation when toggling checked state, eliminating vertical shift\nof content below the checkbox.\n\n- Remove conditional rendering of SVG element\n- Add CSS rule to hide checkmark with opacity: 0 when unchecked\n- Matches stable rendering pattern used by Switch component\n\n* Fix TableHeaderCell test to check specifically for SortIndicator\n\nUpdated test to look for SortIndicator class instead of any SVG element.\nThis prevents false positives from the Checkbox checkmark SVG which is\nnow always present in the DOM (just hidden with opacity when unchecked).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\n