github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Upgrade to React 19 type definitions (#68)\n\nUpdate @types/react from 18.3.27 to 19.2.8 and @types/react-dom from\n18.3.7 to 19.2.3 to match the runtime libraries which are already on\nReact 19.2.3.\n\nReact 19 types introduced stricter null handling for RefObject types.\nThe migration includes:\n\n- Update hook signatures to accept nullable refs (useClickOutside,\n  useFocusTrap, usePopoverPosition)\n- Update component context types to accept nullable refs\n  (NotificationMenuContextValue, PopoverProps, TreeContextValue)\n- Fix Input component ClassValue type incompatibility with bigint\n  literals by converting to ternary expressions\n- Update Tooltip component cloneElement usage for React 19 stricter\n  typing with proper type assertions\n- Update Tree component registerItem implementation to match interface\n\nAll 31 type errors resolved. Tests passing. Build successful.","tree":{"sha":"afc60a2eb760aed81cf0178984b77a09afadd6f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/trees/afc60a2eb760aed81cf0178984b77a09afadd6f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whatisboom/boom-ui/git/commits/56a13e3003c7920c0bbc440fc33720ba3ca483a9","verification":{"payload":"tree afc60a2eb760aed81cf0178984b77a09afadd6f0\nparent 03560492f336faca1cc12cf676e707aea4bab560\nauthor Brandon Jernigan <brandon@whatisboom.com> 1768786720 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768786720 +0000\n\nUpgrade to React 19 type definitions (#68)\n\nUpdate @types/react from 18.3.27 to 19.2.8 and @types/react-dom from\n18.3.7 to 19.2.3 to match the runtime libraries which are already on\nReact 19.2.3.\n\nReact 19 types introduced stricter null handling for RefObject types.\nThe migration includes:\n\n- Update hook signatures to accept nullable refs (useClickOutside,\n  useFocusTrap, usePopoverPosition)\n- Update component context types to accept nullable refs\n  (NotificationMenuContextValue, PopoverProps, TreeContextValue)\n- Fix Input component ClassValue type incompatibility with bigint\n  literals by converting to ternary expressions\n- Update Tooltip component cloneElement usage for React 19 stricter\n  typing with proper type assertions\n- Update Tree component registerItem implementation to match interface\n\nAll 31 type errors resolved. Tests passing. Build successful.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpbYsgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArJsQAAsA66W4H42JvzT1HqxMC/Zv\niw7X68px18O6hvGjltyryfFl7+xY/Ba3QDUl7Pd2jmk+88zmO46C4QzwUU7rDlQH\nUV7l3dcKrcmbH6xQDPCfss5Y3LGCZUFPHxNVMV999udCHkgBXHAS/5HVSPSuy4ln\nxL8uHI6iuSKRbUZYsjLzIe6DijtqiEHLqFtJTIWa3kG/oZXFOMGXE+I7ffDSx8nQ\n3ttNK9DV2kl4YZlc8BUSFIPF7JyWDCcVZCzoXAe1gqrarQZP9BCM6vmwpFaVeTBv\nPHwXsY8RxxTCJcKRKnUQYTwSPaNFYp/3g3IT6/1aOgCz/yTzyKhaW+edBe4s4gQi\nJtgQNR5eeHkV2jOsmcIR04W1KxuqXEhzoqJCyjz4jLdIrV3ewbqgTa1ZBJIiu2NW\ncZGmKdL9nrd3N/SlA1QB4/BmheBWXFbF9Tyx4dtTbOm6DaGQXO1DVVW596yx50U8\nVyL2lLmJSP39Kn/aNY7VSui+wQHO1Wzt+OEZX3SDUHFWAHOrXTMoe09LHI9gPLfs\n1rvkr+VwJapNzvtyvYK1yspxYUJzFe2O11U6rehGULv9f5HkgW/h9rHrAP8YvxZi\nNahF3ebTazTv/iiQTOFRGr0HL3HH81QTlDI/bWD7kblYbW67jlp8lOodzEi3BSkJ\nuSs+eTteTL80BzxPlEXW\n=6H8n\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-19T01:38:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we