anfox","id":292384,"login":"nathanfox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjM4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanfox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanfox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanfox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanfox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanfox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathanfox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanfox/mfe-svelte-shell-example/commits/b059d4fe9aa6b4b646aaf489019d74bdabb5e9ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-20T21:01:02Z","email":"nfox.dev@pm.me","name":"Nathan Fox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-20T21:01:02Z","email":"nfox.dev@pm.me","name":"Nathan Fox"},"message":"Add example MFEs for React, Vue, Svelte, SolidJS, and Angular\n\nImplements framework-specific micro-frontends following the MFE lifecycle\ncontract (bootstrap, mount, unmount). Each MFE demonstrates:\n- Dynamic route registration\n- Event bus integration\n- Auth context consumption\n- State caching\n\nKey technical decisions:\n- Build+serve approach for dev (avoids cross-origin HMR issues)\n- Angular uses zoneless change detection for MFE compatibility\n- process.env.NODE_ENV polyfill for browser bundles\n\nAlso fixes MfeContainer infinite loop bug with Svelte 5 reactivity\nby using isMounted guard and $effect.pre for prop changes.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e59c25a2442d91bf6cb1361200420766d6cd350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanfox/mfe-svelte-shell-example/git/trees/6e59c25a2442d91bf6cb1361200420766d6cd350"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanfox/mfe-svelte-shell-example/git/commits/b059d4fe9aa6b4b646aaf489019d74bdabb5e9ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason