d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SKRTEEEEEE/profile-next-template/commits/857776c515bfed999736aa173b8504484c1f6b9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-17T13:33:31Z","email":"adanreh.m@gmail.com","name":"SKRTEEEEEE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-17T13:33:31Z","email":"adanreh.m@gmail.com","name":"SKRTEEEEEE"},"message":"feat: reorganize test structure and implement new testing scripts\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Test structure completely reorganized from flat to hierarchical\n\n## 📁 New Structure\n\n### Tests reorganized into two main categories:\n- **tests/vitest/** - Fast unit tests (no browser, ~2s)\n  - unit/ - Pure functions, utils (27 tests)\n  - component/ - Testing Library component tests\n  - api/ - API data/logic tests\n\n- **tests/pw/** - Playwright tests (requires server)\n  - unit/ - 65 tests (to migrate to vitest)\n  - api/ - 4 tests (to migrate to vitest)\n  - component/ - 5 visual component tests\n  - integration/ - 9 integration tests (SSR, i18n, SEO, a11y)\n  - e2e/ - 3 E2E workflow tests (NEW!)\n  - performance/ - 6 performance tests (moved from e2e/performance)\n\n## 🎯 Key Changes\n\n### 1. Test Structure Migration\n- Deleted legacy flat structure (unit/, api/, component/, integration/, pages/, e2e/, performance/)\n- Created organized pw/ and vitest/ hierarchy\n- Moved performance tests from e2e/performance/ → performance/\n- Migrated vitest tests to vitest/unit/\n\n### 2. New Scripts (package.json)\n```\nVITEST (fast, no server):\n- vitest          - Watch mode\n- vitest:run      - Run once\n- vitest:cov      - With coverage\n- vitest:ui       - Visual UI\n\nPLAYWRIGHT (needs server):\n- pw              - All tests\n- pw:unit         - Unit only\n- pw:api          - API only\n- pw:component    - Component only\n- pw:integration  - Integration only\n- pw:e2e          - E2E only\n- pw:performance  - Performance only\n- pw:cov          - With NYC coverage\n\nCOMBINED:\n- test:cov        - Full coverage (vitest + pw)\n- test:all        - All tests\n\nLEGACY (deprecated):\n- test:unit       - pw:unit + pw:api\n- test:server     - pw:component + pw:integration\n- test:e2e        - pw:e2e\n- test:perf       - pw:performance\n```\n\n### 3. Gradients Page Enhanced\n- Added proper h1 with i18n translations\n- Complete page structure with main/header/section\n- Fixed tests: gradients-page.spec.ts ✅\n- Added translations for 4 locales (es/en/ca/de)\n\n### 4. E2E Tests Created\nNew file: tests/pw/e2e/admin-workflow.spec.ts\n- Complete admin workflow (navigation + interactions)\n- Locale switching test (es/ca/en)\n- Theme toggle test\n- CRUD workflow example (commented, ready to implement)\n\n### 5. Playwright Config Updated\n- New project names: pw:unit, pw:api, pw:component, pw:integration, pw:e2e, pw:performance\n- Consistent naming across scripts and config\n- Proper test paths for new structure\n\n### 6. Documentation Updated\n- tests/README.claude.md - Complete structure guide\n- Detailed explanation of each test category\n- CI/CD flow updated (removed perf/perf:check from PR)\n- Coverage thresholds documented\n\n## 🎯 Test Results\n\n✅ Vitest: 27 tests passing (~2s)\n✅ PW Performance: 6 tests passing\n✅ PW E2E: 3 tests passing\n✅ PW Integration: 9 tests passing\n✅ PW Component: 5 tests passing\n\nTotal: 119 tests in new structure\n\n## 📊 CI/CD Flow Changes\n\n### PR on main:\n- npm run test:cov (vitest + playwright coverage)\n- Post metrics comment\n- ❌ Removed: perf, perf:check\n\n### Push on main:\n- npm run vitest:cov only\n\n## 🔧 Files Changed\n\nModified:\n- package.json - New test scripts\n- playwright.config.ts - New project structure\n- vitest.config.ts - Coverage paths\n- src/app/[locale]/gradients/page.tsx - Complete page with h1\n- content/data/*/admin.json - Gradients i18n (4 locales)\n- tests/README.claude.md - Updated documentation\n\nDeleted (37 files):\n- tests/unit/* (6 files)\n- tests/api/* (2 files)\n- tests/component/* (5 files)\n- tests/integration/* (5 files)\n- tests/pages/* (2 files)\n- tests/e2e/performance/* (3 files)\n- tests/performance/* (3 files)\n- tests/vitest/*.test.ts* (3 files - moved to vitest/unit/)\n\nCreated:\n- tests/pw/ - Complete new structure\n- tests/vitest/unit/ - Vitest unit tests\n- tests/pw/e2e/admin-workflow.spec.ts - E2E workflows\n\n## 🚀 Performance\n\n- Vitest unit tests: ~2s (was ~6s before)\n- Better organization by test type\n- Clear separation: fast (vitest) vs slow (playwright)\n- Easier to run specific test categories","tree":{"sha":"33205aef303360eb2ca495331c9f1e046010ed5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SKRTEEEEEE/profile-next-template/git/trees/33205aef303360eb2ca495331c9f1e046010ed5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SKRTEEEEEE/profile-next-template/git/commits/857776c515bfed999736aa173b8504484c1f6b9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125660042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SKRTEEEEEE","id":125660042,"login":"SKRTEEEEEE","node_id":"U_kgDOB31rig","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SKRTEEEEEE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co