 aplicaciones\n- mejorar el manejo de errores en el componente shell con mensajes más claros\n- introducir asistente de IA en la interfaz de Designer para ayuda contextual\n- actualizar la configuración de proxy para soportar la API de roles de usuario","tree":{"sha":"7889ecf8d319b06f41c4146fd1ceb2c6ecb5ced1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/git/trees/7889ecf8d319b06f41c4146fd1ceb2c6ecb5ced1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/git/commits/7758bace2132edd3a5ab171b3a5659f569eafd65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commit/7758bace2132edd3a5ab171b3a5659f569eafd65","node_id":"C_kwDOQt_cQtoAKDc3NThiYWNlMjEzMmVkZDNhNWFiMTcxYjNhNTY1OWY1NjllYWZkNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commit/43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e","sha":"43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commits/43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e"}],"sha":"7758bace2132edd3a5ab171b3a5659f569eafd65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commits/7758bace2132edd3a5ab171b3a5659f569eafd65"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commits/43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T02:15:14Z","email":"gabriel@DESKTOP-CVB2PQ3","name":"gabriel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T02:15:14Z","email":"gabriel@DESKTOP-CVB2PQ3","name":"gabriel"},"message":"feat(app-runtime): agregar servicio app-runtime a docker-compose y mejorar la documentación\n\n- Se introdujo un nuevo servicio `app-runtime` en `docker-compose.yml` para ejecutar el microfrontend en el puerto 4201.\n- Se actualizó `PRD.md` para incluir detalles sobre el sistema de gestión de aplicaciones, incluyendo roles, módulos y menús personalizables.\n- Se mejoró `README.md` agregando una sección sobre gestión de aplicaciones y el nuevo microfrontend app runtime.\n- Se actualizó la configuración de proxy en `proxy.conf.json` para soportar nuevos endpoints de API relacionados con la gestión de aplicaciones.\n- Se agregaron nuevas interfaces y métodos en `middleware.service.ts` para gestionar definiciones de aplicaciones, roles y menús.\n- Se actualizó el middleware de FastAPI para incluir nuevas rutas de aplicaciones que manejan solicitudes relacionadas con apps.","tree":{"sha":"b2d50e6c8e176c5b3466fdb0f93f364f0f2f4552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/git/trees/b2d50e6c8e176c5b3466fdb0f93f364f0f2f4552"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/git/commits/43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commit/43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e","node_id":"C_kwDOQt_cQtoAKDQzMzAwZGU2ZmY5NDNhOTUwYmU5MWI1NTFjOGRkMzEwM2FhMzRjMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commit/5e852989bb9a0bde0687c4601df7a586c2e6cd26","sha":"5e852989bb9a0bde0687c4601df7a586c2e6cd26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commits/5e852989bb9a0bde0687c4601df7a586c2e6cd26"}],"sha":"43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/MiddlewareDesigner/commits/43300de6ff943a950be91b551c8dd3103aa34c1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75853169?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GabrielAlejandroArroyo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.co