rips that are already\nactive in the realtime feed. For all other trips delayInSeconds() returns\nundefined, writedp() skips undefined values and the stale data points were\nthen reset to -1 by garbageColleting. The journey and leg delay data points\nnow receive an explicit null in that case, so \"no realtime data\" is no\nlonger indistinguishable from a delay of -1 seconds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c43f0678f84103b71d066870be7b42a6180f068","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/trees/3c43f0678f84103b71d066870be7b42a6180f068"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/commits/1f64c472d064de7df797d64683135585df2d7bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101348966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17","id":101348966,"login":"tt-tom17","node_id":"U_kgDOBgp2Zg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commit/1f64c472d064de7df797d64683135585df2d7bc6","node_id":"C_kwDOQuA_-NoAKDFmNjRjNDcyZDA2NGRlN2RmNzk3ZDY0NjgzMTM1NTg1ZGYyZDdiYzY","parents":[{