iptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commits/b6fa2d8c89a9ce1c82d26d0890b3e202cfc1f5f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:31:59Z","email":"tgb@kabelmail.de","name":"tt-tom17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:31:59Z","email":"tgb@kabelmail.de","name":"tt-tom17"},"message":"fix(admin): show a stored service that no longer exists\n\nThe service picker is a controlled MUI Select. An instance still holding\nserviceType ''vendo'' produced a value with no matching MenuItem, so the field\nrendered empty, the label did not shrink, and the only explanation was a\nconsole warning about an out-of-range value - on screen it just looked like\nnothing had ever been selected.\n\nThe unknown value is now rendered as a disabled entry (\"vendo:db (no longer\navailable)\"), the form control is marked as an error, and the helper text says\nwhat to do: pick another service and save. Written generically rather than for\n''vendo'', so the next removed service behaves the same way.\n\nTwo translation keys added in all eleven languages: client_removed and\nclientConfig_profile_removed_helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82cdcc7abecf16ef276ab63699f3ece9b697c3bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/trees/82cdcc7abecf16ef276ab63699f3ece9b697c3bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/commits/b6fa2d8c89a9ce1c82d26d0890b3e202cfc1f5f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101348966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17","id":101348966,"login":"tt-tom17","node_id":"U_kgDOBgp2Zg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commit/b6fa2d8c89a9ce1c82d26d0890b3e202cfc1f5f5","node_id":"C_kwDOQuA_-NoAKGI2ZmEyZDhjODlhOWNlMWM4MmQyNmQwODkwYjNlMjAyY2ZjMWY1ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commit/fd59f1bd4594b67971b8d1c58b4fddf6bbb0326e","sha":"fd59f1bd4594b67971b8d1c58b4fddf6bbb0326e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commits/fd59f1bd4594b67971b8d1c58b4fddf6bbb0326e"}],"sha":"b6fa2d8c89a9ce1c82d26d0890b3e202cfc1f5f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commits/b6fa2d8c89a9ce1c82d26d0890b3e202cfc1f5f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101348966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17","id":101348966,"login":"tt-tom17","node_id":"U_kgDOBgp2Zg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commits/fd59f1bd4594b67971b8d1c58b4fddf6bbb0326e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:11:44Z","email":"tgb@kabelmail.de","name":"tt-tom17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T17:11:44Z","email":"tgb@kabelmail.de","name":"tt-tom17"},"message":"feat!: remove the db-vendo-client backend\n\nThe \"Vendo - Deutsche Bahn\" option had already been disabled in the admin UI\nbecause the endpoint answers OPS_BLOCKED (#85), so nobody could select it any\nmore. What stayed behind was dead weight: a service class, its own type\ndeclaration, an entry in every service union, and the db-vendo-client\ndependency.\n\nA stored configuration can still say serviceType: ''vendo'', and those instances\nnow stop with a clear error instead of falling through to the HAFAS branch,\nwhere they would have failed with \"unknown profile: db\" - a message that names\nthe wrong cause. Switching them to another service silently was rejected on\npurpose: a different backend returns different journeys, and that is the user''s\ndecision, not the adapter''s.\n\nRemoved: lib/class/dbVendoService.ts, lib/types/db-vendo-client.d.ts, the\ndb-vendo-client dependency, the disabled admin option, its DB product set, the\nmsg_vendoServiceInitialized translation in all eleven languages, and the\nmentions in the service unions and doc comments.\n\nThe changelog entry is deliberately not part of this commit: the current\nwork-in-progress block belongs to 1.3.0 (TRIAS), and this change is meant for\n2.0.0.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the \"vendo\" service type is gone. Instances still configured\nfor it log an error and stop; they have to be switched to another service, for\nexample \"MOTIS - Transitous\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e1fecf2ddd27b61005ac23c6af01b1e54763ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/trees/5e1fecf2ddd27b61005ac23c6af01b1e54763ea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/commits/fd59f1bd4594b67971b8d1c58b4fddf6bbb0326e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101348966?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17","id":101348966,"login":"tt-tom17","node_id":"U_kgDOBgp2Zg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commit/fd59f1bd4594b67971b8d1c58b4fddf6bbb0326e","node_id":"C_kwDOQuA_-NoAKGZkNTlmMWJkNDU5NGI2Nzk3MWI4ZDFjNThiNGZkZGY2YmJiMDMyNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commit/4d8e3d19958b790de96f48b7555f794c30025bee","sha":"4d8e3d19958b790de96f48b7555f794c30025bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/c