m/users/tt-tom17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tt-tom17","id":101348966,"login":"tt-tom17","node_id":"U_kgDOBgp2Zg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commits/ec4472ea293477bbd23519d55c6f50a361778d45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T08:15:37Z","email":"101348966+tt-tom17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T08:15:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/admin8 gui components (#104)\n\n* feat(admin)!: migrate config GUI to gui-components 10 (React 19, MUI 9)\n\nAdmin 8 ships React 19, MUI 9 and json-config 9 and shares them as module\nfederation singletons, so the custom config components have to be built\nagainst the same stack.\n\n* fix: convert lang-File to short name\n\n* docs: release the admin 8 migration as 1.0.0\n\n* fix: clamp the poll interval to the documented five minute minimum\n\nThe admin input field only restricts the value in the browser; a value\nstored through the object tree or carried over from an older\nconfiguration was passed to the pollers unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"99dd3eb73b919a15c913e7635185eed63152fd46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/trees/99dd3eb73b919a15c913e7635185eed63152fd46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/commits/ec4472ea293477bbd23519d55c6f50a361778d45","verification":{"payload":"tree 99dd3eb73b919a15c913e7635185eed63152fd46\nparent 41679ea1c61145a712921bffff7e6dcfc1a601f9\nauthor Thomas <101348966+tt-tom17@users.noreply.github.com> 1786176937 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786176937 +0200\n\nFeat/admin8 gui components (#104)\n\n* feat(admin)!: migrate config GUI to gui-components 10 (React 19, MUI 9)\n\nAdmin 8 ships React 19, MUI 9 and json-config 9 and shares them as module\nfederation singletons, so the custom config components have to be built\nagainst the same stack.\n\n* fix: convert lang-File to short name\n\n* docs: release the admin 8 migration as 1.0.0\n\n* fix: clamp the poll interval to the documented five minute minimum\n\nThe admin input field only restricts the value in the browser; a value\nstored through the object tree or carried over from an older\nconfiguration was passed to the pollers unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqduWpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzT4QABhcqPBJ5/SF4TJ6HUG76BjR\nOlXDpI8WwaJMdAZToOjeAOlQsfKvOktySZ5LFWfL0UbgzgO8Ka3fnDjjpkNuh1mN\nlTXQHXG6Mrq1VIpcUZBVwlQNovySDhtSUArr3SwoDvt1DTirNyYnVTmH0yw5as5H\n+L7SyzP+M/wo8CENoGECdqUZuFo66PuioHOBkr+ENbeAEnnRt+Y2q9At1ZjNOlPd\nsHl7VZLBkuDpkqKSUI9I3WRhQ99rrrArq/9GVLZ9DQgbRj/EhFzsUprn+G39lFxU\nt21cr/R5QStZN6JxRKuCxiMVlYHKAZKz22vKb0udh0KDGOooUrhP/v/lcd9ndZli\nFsD+XUCyaEolOPaEaG7TyI3x80rwgQnoJ9nQNYXvJ7CSuzUtdHTu1kfsrIVvzEMD\nptqaavQCrEcI2uwQnjeYXG6zUohSV0OZF1E51tlPjSU7etEKFablOUlYQd5J4O4q\nTFnxAiPP4vvWioaoWveyaE9Z7jDYXStL/wKnWX00TKYy4fy7jkJWNbfGDrmYl0An\nAbq7PHlmDOjxl61FKvB7yY15e5M9enCwszZskNyynX7kf/AzEa0ugzs6Lc7DasSp\nWCUrL0UO2LozEmrka3gIlxCSxKnMiPrv3F6YbtpD1P3ZY6gkriLggdyqhmc2mS8F\nVOrWs3AzXQp4T1ZtXmgs\n=l7SD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T08:15:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web