ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-tom17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/commits/a2754b846d0b485455e4bc4f056628c10fbff000/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T17:28:02Z","email":"101348966+tt-tom17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thomas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T17:28:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: per-journey \"Number of transfers\" + robust empty-result handling (#91)\n\n  - Add a per-journey \"Number of transfers\" dropdown (-1 = backend decides,\n    0 = direct connections only, 1-5 = at most that many). Passed as the\n    hafas-client `transfers` option; applies to HAFAS (maxChg) and MOTIS\n    (maxTransfers). i18n for all 11 languages + wiki docs.\n  - Handle HAFAS H890 (\"journeys search unsuccessful\", e.g. transfers=0 with no\n    direct connection) as \"no journeys found\": warn instead of error, clear the\n    states, and stop retrying the deterministic failure.\n  - Neutralize stale channel names: garbageColleting relied on channels being in\n    the in-memory state DB, but startup loaded only states, so vanished legs kept\n    their old \"A -> B\"/line/station labels. Channels are now loaded at startup.","tree":{"sha":"9a0d622206aa285e81a444c63810602be8b929e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/trees/9a0d622206aa285e81a444c63810602be8b929e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-tom17/ioBroker.public-transport/git/commits/a2754b846d0b485455e4bc4f056628c10fbff000","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a0d622206aa285e81a444c63810602be8b929e2\nparent 75ecd47d2655f3299aa4ea51650cf4f586ce35c1\nauthor Thomas <101348966+tt-tom17@users.noreply.github.com> 1784222882 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784222882 +0200\n\nfeat: per-journey \"Number of transfers\" + robust empty-result handling (#91)\n\n  - Add a per-journey \"Number of transfers\" dropdown (-1 = backend decides,\n    0 = direct connections only, 1-5 = at most that many). Passed as the\n    hafas-client `transfers` option; applies to HAFAS (maxChg) and MOTIS\n    (maxTransfers). i18n for all 11 languages + wiki docs.\n  - Handle HAFAS H890 (\"journeys search unsuccessful\", e.g. transfers=0 with no\n    direct connection) as \"no journeys found\": warn instead of error, clear the\n    states, and stop retrying the deterministic failure.\n  - Neutralize stale channel names: garbageColleting relied on channels being in\n    the in-memory state DB, but startup loaded only states, so vanished legs kept\n    their old \"A -> B\"/line/station labels. Channels are now loaded at startup.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWRSiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARUsQABJpDWcOVuz0TMwyDK6Oaoo6\nO5hOI32IclOu2HKmDe4cvTXqKbwFRzjEKxFc1pKevhUldRgZOOmFfYMMapFBogIJ\nVC/RaGCJbHyysPUxP+d9w1zJyXxv8FRrY/qBv5UwxWW9YKtax+y/v3ddwIGo4z98\npz7hiqbZrOqVlroJTJIiBR9lUJLlDgHdXe1a6WjAOsWLn5rmKHnz12K4OqKxZpWF\n8+ZaYUmYLBuv4Yq52suts4YCixXM27JT7JuBFHYkwlK4HtG4jwPwsIaO8xtv6AYW\nlGMN8kTiDOuf3EuvxIq7gjyxTPcQVaKxQPLIEYXUEGACHpPn4w6YDj1BJk7yDhXH\nqSBTGhpzdQW5RkDqH0utvxNS7b8V8u7g1vTTs68gG5LQQNcHfcjPk3lZHM+S22Vf\nPIABfhXGolUo0CU+VQOkRZ5pvW6YQBmezuKlw2C1K7hvgwX+DFT1tyl6Dccc5IEc\nX4/jX3PZUH5aLf2/cv5JpX3i1W8PS29VX0aCx1qkrR7X+ndx3scF0D9rrXeXOwkg\ndvd1BQVEo9H9aVEc3pQYlZwhzqPwGx6SaaxYOy5lmdwPo+jo/5XhyMhWcP8cJNZr\nJLJEOKb28T9eYpop8CxVTgQHuGKvBNt3PUQkei/I27veYCTZujA0DHejqwGVPCcY\nkwjVtvyqjQRCBHFRqgt3\n=iYrZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T17:28:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url