ail.com","name":"JesusTM"},"message":"chore(docker): agregar docker-compose y separar frontend del backend\n\n- Se agregan Dockerfiles y .dockerignore para backend y frontend, y se incorpora docker-compose en modo desarrollo con volúmenes.\n- Se inyecta el .env al contenedor del backend vía env_file para exponer la API key y se evita que el backend intente servir estáticos del frontend.\n- Se ajusta el frontend para llamar a la API en :8000 (/api/chat) manteniendo ambos servicios desacoplados.","tree":{"sha":"f27fb96194e58512b1dd2231c96d1b1e8ba7fea0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JessusTM/Archssistant/git/trees/f27fb96194e58512b1dd2231c96d1b1e8ba7fea0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JessusTM/Archssistant/git/commits/87ed98359d96f40010c30afa38151a7595ce21b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142464450?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JessusTM","id":142464450,"login":"JessusTM","node_id":"U_kgDOCH3Vwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JessusTM","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JessusTM/Archssistant/commit/87ed98359d96f40010c30afa38151a7595ce21b3","node_id":"C_kwDOQuEimdoAKDg3ZWQ5ODM1OWQ5NmY0MDAxMGMzMGFmYTM4MTUxYTc1OTV