1134/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axiao1134/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/axiao1134","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JessusTM/Archssistant/commits/b3bf7cfa70ae1ffbcc962b4a4628a8e8af835682/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-29T01:19:17Z","email":"z.xiao01@ufromail.cl","name":"axiao1134"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-29T01:19:17Z","email":"z.xiao01@ufromail.cl","name":"axiao1134"},"message":"feat(api-gateway): agregar API Gateway con validación centralizada\n\n- Nuevo módulo gateway.py en python_backend/api/\n- Punto de entrada único para solicitudes HTTP\n- Validación centralizada de entrada (_validate_chat_request)\n- Manejo consistente de errores con excepciones personalizadas:\n  - ValidationError (HTTP 400)\n  - AuthenticationError (HTTP 401)\n  - InternalServerError (HTTP 500)\n- Request IDs únicos basados en timestamp ISO para trazabilidad\n- Logging en 5 puntos: entrada, delegación, respuesta, errores\n- Separación clara entre validación y lógica de negocio\n- Documentación en documentation/api_gateway/README.md","tree":{"sha":"ca5c8b2b1a073aa4878aea2feee0da1d12fad3d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JessusTM/Archssistant/git/trees/ca5c8b2b1a073aa4878aea2feee0da1d12fad3d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JessusTM/Archssistant/git/commits/b3bf7cfa70ae1ffbcc962b4a4628a8e8af835682","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137560224?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axiao1134/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axiao1134/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axiao1134/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axiao1134/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/axiao1134","i