driangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/d4188016ef1bece885072fa006b392d84ed2a34c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T04:27:26Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T04:27:26Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: production readiness — 25 security, infra, and DX fixes\n\nBatch 1 (Blocking Security):\n- CORS reflection vulnerability fixed in exception handler and subscription guard\n- BFF CORS locked to explicit allowlist from env var\n- ADMIN_TOKEN removed from frontend JS bundle (3 files)\n- BFF validates JWT session before injecting admin token\n- META_VERIFY_TOKEN/APP_SECRET mandatory, no defaults\n- Meta webhook signature verification always enforced\n- WhatsApp webhook secret race condition eliminated\n\nBatch 2 (High Priority):\n- Port mismatch 80:8080 fixed in docker-compose\n- Dockerfile CMD uses && (migration failure stops server)\n- admin-secret-99 fallback removed (fail-fast)\n- Hardcoded client URLs removed from frontend\n- Billing secrets moved to pydantic Settings\n- SMTP error no longer leaks debug info to client\n- Email verification token expiry (48h) + Alembic migration\n- CORS defaults emptied (no localhost/easypanel)\n- TiendaNube non-standard header documented\n\nBatch 3 (Hardening):\n- nginx: gzip, security headers, asset cache, auth rate limit\n- render.yaml BFF startCommand fixed\n- DB pool configured (10+20, timeout, recycle)\n- Redis fail-closed on login (503 if Redis down)\n- CI/CD pipeline: ruff, tsc, Docker smoke tests\n\nBatch 4 (DX):\n- docker-compose variants fixed (platform_ui → frontend_react)\n- .env.example rewritten (86 variables, grouped by service)\n- Per-service .dockerignore files (7 services)","tree":{"sha":"4dfe14de5be67154a239cbddcffa29752b69d7d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/4dfe14de5be67154a239cbddcffa29752b69d7d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/d4188016ef1bece885072fa006b392d84ed2a34c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangm