sume() for Safari autoplay policy\n- OnboardingWizard: fix stale closure in cancelPlayback mic unmute\n\nResource:\n- nova_daily_analysis: use httpx.AsyncClient as context manager (no leak)\n\nLogin mobile:\n- Full-width card on mobile (remove p-8, use px-4 on container)\n- flex-col for proper footer positioning\n- Footer inside card container for centering\n- Smaller text on mobile (text-2xl vs text-3xl)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e707b46ee8324f313797b66373898c08899ad94d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/e707b46ee8324f313797b66373898c08899ad94d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/d328511b7d557fc99c96e56883794e94a9fc77f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/d328511b7d557fc99c96e56883794e94a9fc