ch targets\n\nMobile adaptations:\n- Panel goes fullscreen on mobile (inset-0), floating on desktop (lg:)\n- Backdrop overlay with blur on mobile when panel is open\n- Body scroll locked when panel open (prevents background scroll)\n- Safe area insets for iOS notch/home bar (env(safe-area-inset-*))\n- viewport-fit=cover in index.html for Safari safe area support\n- Floating button raised (bottom-20) to clear mobile bottom nav\n- Toast spans full width on mobile (left-3 right-3)\n- Larger touch targets: buttons p-3, inputs py-3, tabs py-3\n- Larger text on mobile: text-sm (mobile) → text-xs (desktop via lg:)\n- overscroll-contain prevents rubber-band scroll bleed\n- Input: inputMode=\"text\", enterKeyHint=\"send\", blur after send\n- Active states (active:scale, active:bg-white/5) for touch feedback\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ffd836934e745fa6f1f20de4a71e7b2dca6c0fbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/ffd836934e745fa6f1f20de4a71e7b2dca6c0fbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/74b86f6b64fd13048351e94a917b671b5ba37798","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/