driangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/b9df9f7701d0dc1f9a17ca2804177c4d45e86ba0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T07:18:50Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T07:18:50Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: Nova Phase 4+5 — health-check, daily analysis, voice echo fix\n\nPhase 4 (Proactividad, $0):\n- GET /admin/nova/health-check — 13 SQL checks, score 0-100\n- Score ponderado: agente, prompt quality, canales, productos, knowledge, actividad\n- Greeting contextual basado en score (<50, 50-80, >80)\n- NovaWidget con 3 tabs: Chat, Salud, Insights\n- Toast notification al entrar si hay alertas criticas (1x/sesion)\n\nPhase 5 (Analisis, ~$0.003/tenant/dia):\n- nova_daily_analysis.py — cron cada 12h, analiza conversaciones con GPT-4o-mini\n- GET /admin/nova/daily-analysis — lee analisis de Redis (TTL 48h)\n- Tab Insights: temas frecuentes, problemas, sugerencias con boton \"Aplicar\"\n- Registrado en main.py startup\n\nVoice echo fix:\n- Auto-mute mic cuando Nova habla (novaPlayingRef)\n- Auto-unmute cuando Nova termina (nova_audio_done + response_done)\n- Barge-in: user_speech_started cancela playback + unmute\n- VAD tuning: threshold 0.5, silence 5000ms, prefix 800ms\n- Server forwards response.audio.done + input_audio_buffer.speech_started\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba6964bf2896145ccc51912a0f720dc54f0b272a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/ba6964bf2896145ccc51912a0f720dc54f0b272a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/b9df9f7701d0dc1f9a17ca2804177c4d45e86ba0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gi