d":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/bd90622e03003572e72081d2341247232a885d3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T06:10:22Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T06:10:22Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"plan: Nova Phase 4 (proactivity) + Phase 5 (conversation analysis)\n\nPhase 4 — Proactividad sin IA ($0):\n- Health-check endpoint: 13 SQL checks (products, prompt, channels, etc)\n- Business completeness score 0-100\n- Widget shows score + actionable cards\n- Toast notifications on session start\n- Greeting uses top_priority from health data\n\nPhase 5 — Daily conversation analysis (~$0.003/tenant/day):\n- Cron: fetch last 50 conversations, summarize with GPT-4o-mini\n- Detects: frequent topics, coverage gaps, agent errors\n- Stores analysis in Redis (48h TTL)\n- Widget shows daily insights with \"Apply suggestion\" buttons\n- Auto-apply: preview → confirm → prompt updated\n\nTotal cost: ~$0.09/tenant/month for proactive intelligence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"397360dd02e626bd820cbb90e5a274014e8e34a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/397360dd02e626bd820cbb90e5a274014e8e34a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platf