lProduct\n- Full CRUD: GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /admin/products\n- Bulk create: POST /admin/products/bulk (up to 50)\n- Categories: GET /admin/products/categories\n- CSV template: GET /admin/products/export-template\n- CSV import: POST /admin/products/import (groups variants by name)\n- Internal search endpoints (TN-compatible format):\n  /internal/products/search, /category/{cat}, /featured\n- Free trial limit: 50 products\n\nFrontend (Products.tsx):\n- Products page with grid cards (photo, name, price, stock)\n- Search + category filter\n- Create/Edit modal (name, desc, category, price, stock, SKU)\n- Delete with confirmation\n- Import modal: download template + upload CSV\n- Empty state with CTAs\n- Mobile responsive\n\nRouting: /products route + Sidebar nav item \"Productos\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80f3dc71bc2ada4b9a2229e156c9f9fa9d1f0665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/80f3dc71bc2ada4b9a2229e156c9f9fa9d1f0665"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/1253084f0844019c29f45a12355b6f4bef452621","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","sit