Platform-ROI/commits/334c4d892490732491db03cfa0d28e8806fdbbe8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T05:33:04Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T05:33:04Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"plan: Nova Phase 2 (Products CRUD) + Phase 3 (Agent Tools)\n\nPhase 2 — 12 tasks:\n- internal_products table + SQLAlchemy model\n- Full CRUD endpoints + bulk create\n- Search endpoints (same format as Tienda Nube API)\n- Auto-detect: TN or internal catalog (transparent to agent)\n- Excel/CSV import with template download + preview\n- Image upload per product\n- Products page with grid + edit modal\n- Nova tools: agregar/editar/eliminar/listar/stock/categoría\n\nPhase 3 — 6 tasks:\n- Nova tool: modificar_prompt (add/edit system prompt sections)\n- Nova tools: agregar_regla + agregar_sinonimo\n- Nova tool: ver_prompt_actual + ver_errores_agente\n- Backend endpoint: agent issues (recent derivations)\n- NovaWidget: shows agent errors as actionable suggestions\n\nTotal: 18 tasks across both phases.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebdeb06fbb2c4bdf42290b07f5eb79a6af9949d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/ebdeb06fbb2c4bdf42290b07f5eb79a6af9949d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/334c4d892490732491db03cfa0d28e8806fdbbe8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","grav