ite_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/36561ec24edde5fed020d649ed56be3aab395d24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T05:29:20Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T05:29:20Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: Nova Platform Assistant — Phase 1 widget\n\nBackend (nova_routes.py):\n- GET /admin/nova/context — static SQL checks ($0 cost):\n  products without photos, empty stock, missing channels,\n  short prompts, empty knowledge, trial expiring, etc.\n- POST /admin/nova/session — Realtime session for voice\n- Proactive greetings based on page + real data\n- Shared WS handler with onboarding (/public/nova/ws/)\n\nFrontend (NovaWidget.tsx):\n- Floating button (bottom-right) with gradient + pulse animation\n- Slide-in panel with chat interface\n- Page detection (dashboard/products/agents/chats/etc)\n- Proactive checks as clickable cards (warning/suggestion/alert)\n- Each card navigates to the relevant page\n- Text chat via test-agent endpoint with Nova prompt\n- Hidden on /onboarding-wizard (has its own Nova)\n\nLayout.tsx: NovaWidget integrated globally\nnginx.conf: WS proxy for /api/public/nova/ws/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11007772a2e4c09195ec4fccee8b045b8cb506f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/11007772a2e4c09195ec4fccee8b045b8cb506f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/36561ec24edde5fed020d649ed56be3aab395d24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned",