/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/28e07ae57762202b19f0bff569efc586f48e74e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T22:04:01Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T22:04:01Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: agent uses REAL system prompt from wizard (was using generic)\n\nROOT CAUSE: activateAgent had backslash URL that silently failed.\nThe /complete endpoint was never called → agent kept generic prompt.\n\nFIXES:\nBackend /complete:\n- Uses system_prompt_draft (the real refined prompt) not hardcoded\n- Checks for existing agent → UPDATE instead of creating duplicates\n- Saves knowledge_sources if user selected collections\n- Logs prompt_len for debugging\n\nFrontend activateAgent:\n- Fixed URL (forward slashes)\n- Validates prompt is not empty before activating\n- Removed .catch() on progress save so errors surface\n- Still updates agent with knowledge_sources after creation\n\nNow: wizard prompt → saved to DB → /complete reads it → agent uses it.\nUser can re-run wizard to update existing agent without duplicating.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7a1f56ee4a2c2b9850a091e3c2074831b61ea7e","url":"https: