c586f48e74e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/184fe8904425c7f5d4d7073b465d49a2d036f7d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T21:57:51Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T21:57:51Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: voice mode restores chat history (was always starting from zero)\n\nROOT CAUSE: connectRealtime never sent chat_history to the backend.\nThe Realtime session always started fresh while text mode restored.\n\nFIXES:\n1. Frontend connectRealtime: sends chatHistories[step] to realtime-session\n2. Backend realtime-session: accepts + stores chat_history in Redis\n3. Backend WS handler: injects history as conversation.item.create\n   events before the greeting. Changes greeting to \"Retoma donde\n   la dejamos\" when history exists.\n4. declineVoice: now calls initChatWithVoice (history-aware) instead\n   of initChat (which always reset)\n\nNow both voice AND text mode resume from the last incomplete section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff78bd41cb409bcb73487338059ae50ba6fa9f26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/ff78bd41cb409bcb73487338059ae50ba6fa9f26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/184fe8904425c7f5d4d7073b465d49a2d036f7d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/184fe8904425c7f5d4d7073b465d49a2d036f7d6","node_id":"C_kwDOQuLYWdoAKDE4NGZlODkwNDQyNWM3ZjVkNGQ3MDczYjQ2NWQ0OWEyZDAzNmY3ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd","sha":"ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd"}],"sha":"184fe8904425c7f5d4d7073b465d49a2d036f7d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/184fe8904425c7f5d4d7073b465d49a2d036f7d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T21:49:44Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T21:49:44Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: mic capture uses native sample rate + resamples to 24kHz\n\nROOT CAUSE: AudioContext was forced to 16kHz for capture, but\nOpenAI Realtime expects 24kHz PCM16. Most browsers/devices capture\nat 48kHz. The mismatch caused garbled audio that OpenAI couldn''t\nprocess → no transcription → no response → \"Nova doesn''t hear me\".\n\nFIX: Separate capture AudioContext at native sample rate (48kHz).\nResample from native→24kHz using linear interpolation before\nconverting to PCM16 and sending via WebSocket.\n\nAlso: separate captureAudioCtxRef from playback realtimeAudioCtxRef.\nCleanup closes both contexts independently.\n\nConsole logs native and target sample rates for debugging.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"909bd4a8641ac0196d589c9fe3b1249bcb0dd232","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/909bd4a8641ac0196d589c9fe3b1249bcb0dd232"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd","node_id":"C_kwDOQuLYWdoAKGNjZGMyNTQwNjFhZGZmMzgyOWViNjRmZjE4MzU5YzQ2ZTZhYmRkY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/1c6fea105ffe0eb19793f6d48af84f75081a18e9","sha":"1c6fea105ffe0eb19793f6d48af84f75081a18e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/1c6fea105ffe0eb19793f6d48af84f75081a18e9"}],"sha":"ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/ccdc254061adff3829eb64ff18359c46e6abddcd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/1c6fea105ffe0eb19793f6d48af84f75081a18e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T21:46:16Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T21:46:16Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: Nova scrapes store URL + Facebook + Instagram proactively\n\nGreeting now instructs Nova to:\n1. Show known data via mostrar_dato_extraido\n2. Use investigar_web to scrape ALL available URLs:\n   - Store URL from step 1 (web_research.url in step_data)\n   - Facebook page URL (extracted from meta_summary)\n   - Instagram profile URL (extracted from @username)\n3. Present combined findings from all sources\n4. Ask user to confirm before starting interview\n\nIf no URLs available, Nova asks for them first.\nThis replaces the generic \"no encontré datos\" greeting.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5cd956744bf5c9607fb3baa97dd609199910c291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/5cd956744bf5c9607fb3baa97dd609199910c291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/1c6fea105ffe0eb19793f6d48af84f75081a18e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/1c6fea105