ructured context string\n\nFrontend:\n- Input for web URL in step 1 (below TN connection)\n- \"Analizar mi web\" button triggers async research\n- Results persist in DB (survives page reload)\n- extractMetaData combines Meta assets + web research context\n- Nova gets BOTH social media data AND website content at step 3\n\nThe web research runs in background — user can continue to step 2\nwhile it processes. When Nova starts in step 3, she has the full\ncontext from: social media + website + any manual input.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14878f1726647f69ab9d2ca7f9d69e1a08330c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/14878f1726647f69ab9d2ca7f9d69e1a08330c75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/ce97fbd90f63ec008c3b101e6358caa37c348806","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_u