mail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: test-agent uses real tools + memory + Tienda Nube products\n\nTest agent in wizard review now works like production:\n- Session memory via Redis (keeps last 20 messages, 1h TTL)\n- Real tools: search_specific_products, browse_general_storefront,\n  search_by_category — calls actual Tienda Nube API\n- Tool execution: fetches real products with names and prices\n- Two-step: GPT-4o calls tool → gets real data → generates response\n- Uses _get_platform_key for reliable API key resolution\n\nWhen user asks \"que productos tenes?\" the test agent now returns\nREAL products from their Tienda Nube catalog, not invented ones.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a2ad34e41886deac43c9cced3a52a06f6908d8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/4a2ad34e41886deac43c9cced3a52a06f6908d8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/cce22a951a2318888296348aecccee3ca0c79939","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscription