5fd82db2985/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T19:48:14Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T19:48:14Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: refined prompt includes mandatory TOOLS instructions\n\nThe agent was inventing products instead of using search tools.\nNow the refiner adds a complete HERRAMIENTAS OBLIGATORIAS section:\n- search_specific_products: for any product query\n- search_by_category: for category browsing\n- browse_general_storefront: for \"what do you sell?\"\n- orders: for order status\n- derivhumano: for escalation\n\nREGLA CRITICA: \"que productos tenes?\" → ALWAYS use tools, NEVER invent.\n\"Si no sabes, deci dejame buscar eso y usa la tool.\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88fa40ccc4c18ab98cd1ba10625ad9fee4a2585f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/88fa40ccc4c18ab98cd1ba10625ad9fee4a2585f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/e4432497ed2988cb94137e85b2dda5fd82db2985","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adria