 or store.\n\nVAD tuned: threshold 0.8 (ignores noise), silence 3000ms (waits\n3 full seconds before processing — no more premature cuts).\n\nNova''s instructions updated to list ALL available tools and instruct\nher to use them proactively: \"Pedi al usuario su web o redes si no\ntenes contexto. Usa investigar_web para scrapear antes de preguntar.\"\n\nBuffer omnichannel spec included for future implementation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d650e95f4851998dcf783fb9bed61b93ac955582","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/d650e95f4851998dcf783fb9bed61b93ac955582"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/fb71add350a4fb6bf56c7bfea9f614af263b0b3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/fb71add350a4fb6bf56c7bfea9f61