\nBug: frontend sends {step_3: {chat_history: [...]}} but backend\ntreated the whole object as flat data, nesting incorrectly.\nNow properly handles both keyed ({step_3: {...}}) and flat\n({chat_history: [...], confirmed_sections: {...}}) formats.\n\nAlso: loadProgress reconstructs draft from chat_history in step_data\nwhen system_prompt_draft is empty, as fallback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"727d9b25e71f56f194ccc40cdd81d5f318e73f50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/727d9b25e71f56f194ccc40cdd81d5f318e73f50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/e9afac08164527325df05c03cdafc7c3dc1f13e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/e9afac08164527325df05c03cdafc7c3dc1f13e3","node_id":"C_kwDOQuLYWdoAKGU5YWZhY