ected at the agent: \"Sos el asistente de...\", \"Cuando un cliente\npregunte...\", \"NUNCA digas...\". Each rule is an imperative.\n\nNot a business description — operational instructions ready for\na WhatsApp/IG/FB agent to follow when responding to customers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46977c553e8e547b0b6cee4335cd68c83c52bd5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/46977c553e8e547b0b6cee4335cd68c83c52bd5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/720887a5fd730ea78812d163d069775e7c907fa3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/720887a5fd730ea78812d163d069775e7c907fa3","node_id":"C_kwDOQuLYWdoAKDcyMDg4N2E1ZmQ3MzBlYTc4ODEyZDE2M2QwNjk3NzVlN2M5MDdmYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/Mu