ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/f9f0759b42cb8c6c38bd1afbd0b1cf4279eae992","node_id":"C_kwDOQuLYWdoAKGY5ZjA3NTliNDJjYjhjNmMzOGJkMWFmYmQwYjFjZjQyNzllYWU5OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34","sha":"1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34"}],"sha":"f9f0759b42cb8c6c38bd1afbd0b1cf4279eae992","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/f9f0759b42cb8c6c38bd1afbd0b1cf4279eae992"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T17:12:01Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T17:12:01Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: Realtime Voice Architect v2 — tools + research cards + session guard\n\nBackend (main.py):\n- 7 Nova tools in Realtime session: guardar_identidad, guardar_tono,\n  guardar_reglas, guardar_diccionario, finalizar_configuracion,\n  cambiar_seccion, mostrar_dato_extraido\n- Function call handler: saves prompt sections to DB in real-time,\n  forwards tool events to frontend for UI updates\n- VAD tuned: threshold 0.7, silence 2000ms, prefix 500ms\n- Greeting instructs Nova to use mostrar_dato_extraido first\n\nFrontend (OnboardingWizard.tsx):\n- Session guard: NEVER two WebSockets simultaneously\n- stopRealtimeAudio: full cleanup (WS + mic + AudioContext + queue)\n- Research cards cascade: 3 sec each, fade-in/out, while WS connects\n- extractMetaData builds cards from assets (IG profile, FB page, posts)\n- Section badges: violet with check when Nova calls guardar_*\n- Dynamic section title/buttons from cambiar_seccion tool\n- Dynamic data cards from mostrar_dato_extraido tool\n- finalizar_configuracion closes WS and shows summary\n- Pause mic: mutes stream without closing WS\n- \"Ya termine\": fallback that generates summary via text endpoint\n- goNext: always stops realtime before advancing\n- Audio queue: sequential scheduling, no overlap\n\nSpecs + plan included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ae51ebd19f7b73e7012134f67bed97642b9384a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/2ae51ebd19f7b73e7012134f67bed97642b9384a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34","node_id":"C_kwDOQuLYWdoAKDFiNGM1YWFlMTNlOWRhYTFjZGRjYzY2N2YxZDY1NThjMzE5NDVjMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/714155634071f8518a1e58bf2e2974a7a9431fd1","sha":"714155634071f8518a1e58bf2e2974a7a9431fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/714155634071f8518a1e58bf2e2974a7a9431fd1"}],"sha":"1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/1b4c5aae13e9daa1cddcc667f1d6558c31945c34"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/714155634071f8518a1e58bf2e2974a7a9431fd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T16:23:13Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T16:23:13Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: ensure tenant_id reaches extract-meta-data correctly\n\nFrontend: extractMetaData now fetches progress endpoint to get\ntenant_id if state is null (timing issue on first load).\n\nBackend: fallback queries business_assets directly for tenants\nwith active facebook/instagram assets instead of using the\ngeneric onboarding_progress table (which returns wrong tenant).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a29fc678ff16d8c874928823d3ff3b4e2b15735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/0a29fc678ff16d8c874928823d3ff3b4e2b15735"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/71415