ils (common in cross-origin EasyPanel),\n   falls back to initChatWithVoice (text+TTS) instead of silent text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9c2887a8add1d308421fb66d1b27fbd83629d9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/a9c2887a8add1d308421fb66d1b27fbd83629d9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/387ac468536f3c088758214cbc83441a11063ade","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/387ac468536f3c088758214cbc83441a11063ade","node_id":"C_kwDOQuLYWdoAKDM4N2FjNDY4NTM2ZjNjMDg4NzU4MjE0Y2JjODM0NDFhMTEwNjNhZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commit/457ce7738045600696434740d16e0afbadce7df8","sha":"457ce7738045600696434740d16e0afbadce7df8","url":"https://api.github.com/r