adrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: architect extracts Meta data before starting conversation\n\nNew endpoint POST /admin/onboarding/extract-meta-data:\n- Reads connected business_assets from DB (FB pages + IG profiles)\n- Uses stored page tokens to fetch from Graph API:\n  - FB: name, category, about, description, fan_count, recent posts\n  - IG: username, bio, followers, media_count, recent captions\n- Returns structured context string\n\nFrontend integration:\n- extractMetaData() called before chat starts (on acceptVoice)\n- Context injected into the first message to the architect\n- Architect starts with: \"Vi que tu Instagram @X tiene Y seguidores,\n  tu bio dice Z...\" — already knows about the business\n- No textareas needed — data comes from the connected tokens\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb94501932411eaf599d007dc728830ce4b582a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/bb94501932411eaf599d007dc728830ce4b582a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/619dc80c82f99a30700d96c8fef4c7ec7a075689","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ad