iangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/143391b651eaef943632a4308222dce074283fb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T14:38:59Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T14:38:59Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: Dockerfile accepts both VITE_META_APP_ID and VITE_FACEBOOK_APP_ID\n\nEasyPanel uses VITE_META_APP_ID but code expects VITE_FACEBOOK_APP_ID.\nNow both ARGs are accepted and cross-assigned as fallback.\nAlso added VITE_META_EMBEDDED_SIGNUP build arg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa3863bd06cd5d2800f0e47c5b93360270eaafdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/fa3863bd06cd5d2800f0e47c5b93360270eaafdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/143391b651eaef943632a4308222dce074283fb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url