_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T14:25:43Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: persist chat history + resume conversation on wizard reload\n\nBackend:\n- interview-step accepts chat_history param for re-seeding context\n- When user returns, prior conversation is loaded into AI memory\n- AI is told to \"continue where we left off\" with full context\n\nFrontend:\n- Auto-saves chat history to DB after each message exchange (saveChatToDb)\n- Saves confirmed_sections and voice_consent to step_data\n- On reload: restores chat histories for steps 3-4-5 from DB\n- initChatWithVoice sends saved history to re-seed backend session\n- AI remembers everything discussed and picks up from last incomplete item\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca2e99ebd943b660d7ad8bed9a21f19f75b06dca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/ca2e99ebd943b660d7ad8bed9a21f19f75b06dca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/62aef0ebe63b16546d00dbc0702b452f82b0786d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url"