14:06:34Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T14:06:34Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"fix: STT Safari compatibility + deep Pointe Coach prompts rewrite\n\nSTT fixes:\n- Safari: continuous=false, auto-restart on end/no-speech\n- interimResults=true for real-time feedback\n- 3s silence threshold (balanced: not too aggressive, not too slow)\n- Clean up existing recognition before starting new one\n- Error handling for not-allowed, no-speech, aborted\n- Console logging for debugging\n\nPrompts rewrite (Pointe Coach quality):\n- Step 3: Deep identity interview — asks about ideal client, history,\n  differentiator. Uses scenarios: \"Imaginemos que...\" \"Contame un caso...\"\n  Forces 3-4 min of detailed conversation before confirming each section\n- Step 4: Rules via real scenarios — \"Si un cliente devuelve zapatillas\n  usadas...\" Covers shipping, returns, payments, hours, prohibitions\n- Step 5: Dictionary with forced examples — products, abbreviations,\n  misspellings. \"Tus clientes escriben ''cuanto bale'' con b?\"\n- All prompts: REGLA DE ORO — if user gives short answers, ALWAYS\n  ask for more details. Never accept one-word answers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f67022ff2ed0c176f840b33cb1cafb6755c14963","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/f67022ff2ed0c176f840b33cb1cafb6755c14963"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/474b3c698460acbf1e46e8a81e4fd214d0232acc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","follo