a/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/e1122f5ea406a738d4b8a9e5d1f654188c842b9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T10:01:07Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T10:01:07Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: step 2 WhatsApp provider choice — YCloud or Meta Direct\n\nNew flow in onboarding step 2:\n1. User chooses WhatsApp provider: \"Meta Directo\" (recommended) or \"YCloud\"\n2. If YCloud: enter API Key + Webhook Secret → saved encrypted in credentials\n3. If Meta: FB.login flow with MetaOnboardingWizard (same as Settings page)\n4. After YCloud saved: option to also connect Meta for IG/FB Messenger\n5. Connected assets grid (FB/IG/WA) shown for 10s → auto-advance to step 3\n\nYCloud credentials use same encrypted storage pattern as MetaSettings.\nBoth providers can coexist (YCloud for WA + Meta for IG/FB).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0644efe8447584e87d639f72a3359ac5a49f4d0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/0644efe8447584e87d639f72a3359ac5a49f4d0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/e1122f5ea406a738d4b8a9e5d1f654188c842b9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","