,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/commits/d91ac70d9275b7554b281bb2a5850a81fe4f6128/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T08:29:49Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T08:30:21Z","email":"gamarraadrian200@gmail.com","name":"Adrian Gamarra"},"message":"feat: voice architect — TTS auto-speak + STT auto-listen in onboarding\n\nBackend:\n- POST /admin/onboarding/tts: OpenAI TTS proxy (voice nova, tts-1, MP3)\n- _get_platform_key() DRY helper for API key resolution\n- Updated prompts with <CONFIRM:section> tags for sub-confirmations\n- Prompts optimized for voice: short, no markdown, voseo argentino\n\nFrontend (OnboardingWizard.tsx):\n- Consent card at step 3: \"Iniciar experiencia de voz\" + mic permission\n- playTTS(): fetches MP3 from backend, plays via Audio API\n- Auto-cycle: speak → listen (2s silence trigger) → process → speak\n- 15s total silence → mic auto-off\n- Voice state indicators: \"Hablando...\", \"Te escucho...\", \"Procesando...\"\n- Toggle \"Voz activa / Modo texto\" always visible\n- Inline confirm buttons: \"Confirmar tono\", \"Cambiar algo\"\n- Chat history preserved per step (chatHistories map)\n- goBack/goToStep restore history without re-greeting\n\nSpecs + plan included.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af7e20d6067aea9f6d4c6cad13cb3db3b9de3e7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/af7e20d6067aea9f6d4c6cad13cb3db3b9de3e7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/d91ac70d9275b7554b281bb2a5850a81fe4f6128","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","