ing VITE_META_APP_ID which doesn''t exist in the\nproject configuration. All other files (docker-compose, Dockerfile, .env.example,\nuseFacebookSdk.ts) use VITE_FACEBOOK_APP_ID. This mismatch caused the\n\"Identificador de la app no válido\" error during Meta connection.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011eZx4bNnnia5zQ7XMuC4uD","tree":{"sha":"eeec5c1a0a70eff6dc33ab7f6631735e027b2286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/trees/eeec5c1a0a70eff6dc33ab7f6631735e027b2286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/MultiAgents-Platform-ROI/git/commits/3c9c1f5cf957930e6000c168ac7c39d9c8912f0b","verification":{"payload":"tree eeec5c1a0a70eff6dc33ab7f6631735e027b2286\nparent b93861ea746493c9825eeb4d4fd56e45e62b256f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774425326 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774425326 +0000\n\nFix Meta OAuth: use correct env var VITE_FACEBOOK_APP_ID in onboarding\n\nThe OnboardingWizard was using VITE_META_APP_ID which doesn''t exist in the\nproject configuration. All other files (docker-compose, Dockerfile, .env.example,\nuseFacebookSdk.ts) use VITE_FACEBOOK_APP_ID. This mismatch caused the\n\"Identificador de la app no válido\" error during Meta connection.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011eZx4bNnnia5zQ7XMuC4uD\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQITn6jVr\n3kpjQAyua1sXfzwHVsbHgFSbqd+6axD0LePPLNHfpOKs7EBaUJ9VPTBmoerlrsOP/ekwxUPm2eRp\nhQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-25T07:55:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_ur