e\n- Add GitHub Actions CI workflow (lint, test, build, docker-build)\n\nFrontend Optimizations:\n- Dynamic loading of TradingViewChart, ProTradingChart, FibonacciChart via defineAsyncComponent\n- Add Suspense boundaries with loading fallbacks for async chart components\n- Add v-memo to stable lists (transactions, watchlist, wallet holdings, alerts)\n- Add v-once to static content blocks (LearnContent, DocsContent)\n\nCleanup:\n- Remove old Playwright screenshot artifact","tree":{"sha":"d4473195fc30e6619f3a60c9ec4a50ceead432c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/git/trees/d4473195fc30e6619f3a60c9ec4a50ceead432c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/git/commits/b0b8aeb8193daf963d3f6bcf00aef87f79483676","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70656962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet","id":70656962,"login":"VulnerablePlanet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjU2OTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commit/b0b8aeb8