lidation, mathjs removal, ESLint, Suspense\n\n- Consolidate 4 technical indicator implementations → 1 (npm technicalindicators)\n- Consolidate 3 candlestick pattern implementations → 1 (canonical: talib/patterns)\n- Remove mathjs dependency (~180KB) — replace with 2-line native mean/std\n- Add .lean() to 3 read-only MongoDB queries (transactions, notifications, users)\n- Remove unnecessary User.findById re-fetch in auth/me (user already on req)\n- Setup ESLint (flat config) + Prettier with lint/format npm scripts\n- Add Suspense + LoadingSpinner fallback to App.vue for route transitions\n- Add engines.node >=18.0.0 field to package.json\n- Update @vitejs/plugin-vue to ^6.0.6 for vite 8.x compatibility","tree":{"sha":"46017581fadd7163b40b5057c0ce16cdbc14a493","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/git/trees/46017581fadd7163b40b5057c0ce16cdbc14a493"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/git/commits/323adc849286cee61633fa1a6f4ec8fa5c5c6384","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70656962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet","id":70656962,"login":"VulnerablePlanet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjU2OTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commit/323adc849286cee61633fa1a6f4ec8fa5c5c6384","node_id":"C_kwDOQug7rNoAKDMyM2FkYzg0OTI4NmNlZTYxNjMzZmExYTZmNGVjOGZhNWM1YzYzODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commit/f84fccb4467b8e7b00a227c77fbb2c4f97f3ab68","sha":"f84fccb4467b8e7b00a227c77fbb2c4f97f3ab68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commits/f84fccb4467b8e7b00a227c77fbb2c4f97f3ab68"}],"sha":"323adc849286cee61633fa1a6f4ec8fa5c5c6384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commits/323adc849286cee61633fa1a6f4ec8fa5c5c6384"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70656962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet","id":70656962,"login":"VulnerablePlanet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjU2OTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commits/f84fccb4467b8e7b00a227c77fbb2c4f97f3ab68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-08T20:27:07Z","email":"boterocastrosergioandres@gmail.com","name":"Sergio"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-08T20:27:07Z","email":"boterocastrosergioandres@gmail.com","name":"Sergio"},"message":"feat(audit): Phase 1+2 remediation — security hardening, kill switch, code consolidation\n\nPhase 1 — Security & Integrity (13 fixes):\n- Add helmet security headers + rate limiting (global + auth endpoints)\n- Restrict JWT algorithms to HS256, strengthen JWT secret (128-char hex)\n- Implement refresh token rotation (revoke old, issue new on refresh)\n- Hash refresh tokens with SHA-256 in DB, add revoked field\n- Hash API keys with bcrypt (was insecure SHA-256 without salt)\n- Remove duplicate UserId index on ApiKey, remove duplicate SIGINT handler\n- Strengthen password policy (min 8 chars, upper+lower+digit required)\n- Protect /api/auth/user-count with auth middleware\n- Fix MySQL zero-value bug (|| → ??) in macd.js indicator\n- Update express 4.18.2→5.2.1, vite 5.4.0→5.4.21, jsonwebtoken→9.0.3, mongoose→latest\n\nPhase 1 — Trading Agent (3 fixes):\n- Activate KillSwitch: refactor to EventEmitter class, initialize in routes/agent.js\n- Fix kill switch check logic (was always truthy, now checks .triggered)\n- Add cycle overlap guard (skip tick if previous cycle still running)\n\nPhase 2 — Code Consolidation:\n- Extract ~600 lines duplicated Fibonacci pivot logic into pivotDetectionService.js\n- Standardize ALL error responses to { success, message } format\n- Add express-validator to 12+ unprotected endpoints\n- Replace 37+ raw console.log with centralized logger utility\n- Refactor 5 views to use @/utils/currency (remove ~80 lines inline formatters)\n- Create shared constants/crypto.js (coins, exchanges, timeframes)\n- Add barrel exports (7 index.js) to all component directories\n- Fix computed-as-function anti-pattern in crypto/portfolio/transactions stores\n- Add proper 404 NotFoundContent page (replaces silent redirect)\n- Remove Pokemon playground module (5 files + 4 references)","tree":{"sha":"88c881ae22f2c9c47cf8be9908d71e976c5b98f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/git/trees/88c881ae22f2c9c47cf8be9908d71e976c5b98f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/git/commits/f84fccb4467b8e7b00a227c77fbb2c4f97f3ab68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70656962?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet","id":70656962,"login":"VulnerablePlanet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjU2OTYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VulnerablePlanet","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commit/f84fccb4467b8e7b00a227c77fbb2c4f97f3ab68","node_id":"C_kwDOQug7rNoAKGY4NGZjY2I0NDY3YjhlN2IwMGEyMjdjNzdmYmIyYzRmOTdmM2FiNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commit/d383bc09797b3637d31ff4a1191cb1613537d48e","sha":"d383bc09797b3637d31ff4a1191cb1613537d48e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VulnerablePlanet/CryptoProject/commits/d383bc09797b3637d31ff4a1191cb1613537d48e"}],"sha":"f84fccb4467b8e7