2028,"login":"ck-kiran","node_id":"U_kgDODYdRfA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ck-kiran/dsa-playground/commits/16207a6c05f9545f4c86bf369b17aee9a50f163a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-25T08:47:25Z","email":"kiran.ck.work@gmail.com","name":"Kiran C"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-25T08:47:25Z","email":"kiran.ck.work@gmail.com","name":"Kiran C"},"message":"feat: enhance DSA playground with new pages and Tailwind CSS integration\n\n- Updated package.json to include new dependencies for Tailwind CSS and PostCSS.\n- Added postcss.config.mjs for PostCSS configuration.\n- Created new pages for DSA problems, patterns, and topics with dynamic routing.\n- Implemented DSA layout with a sidebar for navigation.\n- Developed a dashboard page for DSA topics with visualizations.\n- Enhanced global styles with Tailwind CSS and custom theming.\n- Introduced a ThemeProvider for managing light and dark modes.\n- Updated tailwind.config.ts for improved theming and animations.\n- Refactored main page to redirect to the DSA dashboard.","tree":{"sha":"8c7a382e5ef1e4e9971406c13b692bdfa3362f2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ck-kiran/dsa-playground/git/trees/8c7a382e5ef1e4e9971406c13b692bdfa3362f2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ck-kiran/dsa-playground/git/commits/16207a6c05f9545f4c86bf369b17aee9a50f163a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226972028?