ithub.com/users/ck-kiran/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ck-kiran","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ck-kiran/dsa-playground/commits/080ad89b42a4a365391b60df9cff969d27548398/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-25T07:47:02Z","email":"kiran.ck.work@gmail.com","name":"Kiran C"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-25T07:47:02Z","email":"kiran.ck.work@gmail.com","name":"Kiran C"},"message":"feat(dsa): implement DSA sidebar, topic cards, and playground functionality\n\n- Added DsaSidebar component for navigation through DSA topics.\n- Created TopicCard component to display individual topics with icons and descriptions.\n- Implemented Controls component for step navigation in the playground.\n- Defined data structure for DSA topics, patterns, and problems in topics.ts.\n- Developed CodeEditor component for code input and visualization.\n- Built DsaPlaygroundPage to manage problem statements, code execution, and visualization.\n- Added ArrayVisualizer and TwoSumVisualizer components for visual representation of algorithms.\n- Instrumented code execution to log steps and visualize algorithm progress.\n- Enhanced styling with Tailwind CSS for improved UI/UX.","tree":{"sha":"5dd856f107297bf49507b8178f5a7d9bab566160","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ck-kiran/dsa-playground/git/trees/5dd856f107297bf49507b8178f5a7d9bab566160"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ck-kiran/dsa-playground/git/commits/080ad89b42a4a365391b60df9cff969d27548398","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser